00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:19.380
and I had written in one of my old blogs that filming the scene where I don't help you put the tablecloth on was one of my favorites of the whole episode.

628
00:24:21.550 --> 00:24:24.070
Such, like, passive-aggressive defiance.

629
00:24:24.210 --> 00:24:25.030
I loved it.

630
00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:26.210
I loved it.

631
00:24:26.370 --> 00:24:30.830
Well, Jenna, I went and found my MySpace blogs, so they're not online anymore.

