1493
01:00:44.800 --> 01:00:45.780
That's Greg Daniels.

1494
01:00:45.860 --> 01:00:46.020
Yeah.

1495
01:00:46.020 --> 01:00:50.420
Because he was such a master at beautiful callback moments.

1496
01:00:51.060 --> 01:00:52.200
