1526
01:02:23.060 --> 01:02:30.120
Jeff Blitz said the same thing to me when I was in the car with Oscar, and I say I love Dwight.

1527
01:02:30.660 --> 01:02:36.940
He said, Angela, in this moment, express your love for the show and everyone,

1528
01:02:37.200 --> 01:02:39.520
