1529
01:02:40.580 --> 01:02:41.980
And I disintegrated.

1530
01:02:41.980 --> 01:02:42.400
Yeah.

1531
01:02:43.320 --> 01:02:50.480
So I'm on camera, and I open up this note that John's written me, and I just start crying.

1532
01:02:50.740 --> 01:02:51.940
I just start bawling.

1533
01:02:52.180 --> 01:02:54.300
It probably, the first take was probably not usable.

1534
01:02:56.640 --> 01:02:58.120
It was the sweetest note.

1535
01:02:58.260 --> 01:03:05.360
And you know, on camera, Pam says, I'll never say what it said, but just know it was perfect.

1536
01:03:06.740 --> 01:03:12.040
Well, I'll never say exactly what John wrote, but I will say, just know it was perfect.

1537
01:03:13.420 --> 01:03:15.460
So that's what was in the teapot note, guys.

1538
01:03:15.620 --> 01:03:17.720
It was a note from John to me.

1539
01:03:17.880 --> 01:03:21.360
A personal note about what it meant to work with you on the show.

1540
01:03:21.460 --> 01:03:21.720
Yeah.

1541
01:03:21.920 --> 01:03:22.220
Yeah.

1542
01:03:22.360 --> 01:03:24.220
About our time together on the show, and it was really sweet.

1543
01:03:24.420 --> 01:03:27.140
Well, that would completely wreck me.

1544
01:03:27.600 --> 01:03:27.840
Yeah.

1545
01:03:28.560 --> 01:03:29.940
Oh, I love that.

1546
01:03:30.080 --> 01:03:31.040
I didn't know that.

1547
01:03:31.040 --> 01:03:31.720
Are you okay?

1548
01:03:32.120 --> 01:03:32.520
Yeah.

1549
01:03:32.520 --> 01:03:35.860
Well, crap, how do we talk about anything else that was so beautiful?

1550
01:03:36.380 --> 01:03:36.720
I'm sorry.

1551
01:03:36.980 --> 01:03:38.080
That was so beautiful.

1552
01:03:38.080 --> 01:03:40.920
I love that that was the direction that Greg gave.

1553
01:03:41.120 --> 01:03:46.040
Those moments became very honest for us under that kind of direction.

1554
01:03:46.540 --> 01:03:46.980
Yeah.

1555
01:03:47.240 --> 01:03:49.180
And we all had little moments like that.

1556
01:03:49.280 --> 01:03:50.520
That's a really big one, though.

1557
01:03:50.680 --> 01:03:53.380
Well, there were those moments on the show that were surprises.

1558
01:03:53.900 --> 01:03:54.020
Yeah.

1559
