1585
01:04:52.260 --> 01:04:52.700
Wow.

1586
01:04:53.040 --> 01:04:53.440
Yes.

1587
01:04:53.700 --> 01:04:55.500
Angela loses it.

1588
01:04:56.020 --> 01:04:56.780
Loses it.

1589
01:04:56.880 --> 01:04:58.960
And this takes us outside.

1590
01:04:59.640 --> 01:05:03.760
She's left the party, and now I have some stuff to tell you guys about this scene.

1591
01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:03.950
Oh, yeah.

1592
01:05:04.600 --> 01:05:05.040
All right.

1593
