1596
01:05:12.340 --> 01:05:16.160
You have a guy up on the roof, and he's got the soap snow.

1597
01:05:16.480 --> 01:05:16.760
Yep.

1598
01:05:16.880 --> 01:05:17.500
That he's going to-

1599
01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:18.420
Falling into your eyes.

