1666
01:07:57.240 --> 01:08:00.600
Was that your intention going in when you're like, I have an idea.

1667
01:08:00.680 --> 01:08:01.120
I can do it.

1668
01:08:01.160 --> 01:08:01.440
I can do it.

1669
01:08:01.440 --> 01:08:04.720
I was thinking if I can't get them to break, I have to start stomping on them.

1670
01:08:04.760 --> 01:08:05.080
Yes.

1671
01:08:05.200 --> 01:08:06.360
So that's what I just did.

1672
01:08:06.460 --> 01:08:07.640
That was just an improv in the moment.

1673
01:08:07.760 --> 01:08:08.860
I just started stomping on them.

1674
01:08:09.260 --> 01:08:11.400
Folks, notice I'm wearing my Sass shoes.

1675
01:08:11.720 --> 01:08:13.820
Oh, that's the perfect shoe for this.

1676
01:08:13.900 --> 01:08:14.580
I know.

1677
01:08:14.780 --> 01:08:15.900
And so I shriek.

1678
01:08:16.020 --> 01:08:16.880
I get to the wall.

1679
01:08:16.880 --> 01:08:17.940
I'm stomping things.

1680
01:08:18.080 --> 01:08:19.280
I ripped the box apart.

1681
01:08:19.800 --> 01:08:20.940
We got the scene.

1682
01:08:21.540 --> 01:08:21.800
Oh.

