Next up is Booze Cruise with our special guest, creator of the American office, Greg Daniels.

1917
01:17:25.200 --> 01:17:26.980
Greg Daniels is going to be here.

1918
01:17:27.140 --> 01:17:28.660
We are super excited.

1919
01:17:28.980 --> 01:17:30.400
We cannot wait to talk to him.

1920
01:17:30.400 --> 01:17:31.740
Thank you, Greg, in advance.

1921
01:17:32.260 --> 01:17:34.640
And Booze Cruise is a huge, huge episode.

1922
